    "body": "## Purpose\n\nThe out-of-tree quantization plugin guide documents only the modular\n`apply` path of `FusedMoEMethodBase`. It doesn't mention that a method\nwhich performs routing internally should override the `is_monolithic`\nproperty to return `True` and implement `apply_monolithic` instead. This\nadds a short note after the MoE example pointing out the two paths and\ntheir signatures.\n\nDocs only, no behavior change.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n- `pre-commit run markdownlint-cli2 --files docs/features/quantization/README.md`\n- Signatures copied from\n  `vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/fused_moe_method_base.py` on main.\n\nFollow-up to #62187. The import / signature fixes for the stale\n`FusedMoE` references are tracked in #50598; this note covers the\n`is_monolithic` / `apply_monolithic` gap that #50598 doesn't.\n",
